WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:01,590
I'm curious about that world

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:02,830
what happened

3
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,830
When I thought that the edge was getting thicker, I hit Rainbow Dash.

4
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:07,310
I just want to pull his hair

5
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:08,310
Send my mother and money

6
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:11,070
But the reality is that I still dare not follow my mother

7
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:13,150
Admit that I have a child Yunzhen

8
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:15,270
When will Rainbow Dash become Ultraman next?

9
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:17,710
When did I mention Ultraman?

10
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:19,760
When it’s not all Ultraman

11
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,480
I want to ask the jellyfish where in the world did I burn it?

12
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:25,730
I'm not an ugly person, am I?

13
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:27,830
Rainbow Dash says mom is beautiful

14
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:29,640
you have always been beautiful

15
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,940
Only the two of us know that she comes from a parallel time and space.

16
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:38,170
What I have to do is protect you, why don't you stand still?

17
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,570
Protecting Rainbow Dash is enough

18
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:41,250
I didn't tell your brother about this.

19
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,120
Rainbow Dash is our child, of course it’s only you.

20
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:50,380
This hand is really not Yunzhen's fault at all.

21
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:52,820
Then don’t they think Rainbow Dash is me and you?
